# The build needs exactly the server package and its shared path dependency.
**
!characters_mirror_server/
!characters_mirror_server/**
!characters_mirror_shared/
!characters_mirror_shared/**

# Local/generated artifacts and private credentials must never enter the image.
**/.dart_tool
**/.dart_tool/**
**/build
**/build/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config/passwords.yaml
**/config/firebase_service_account_key.json
**/config/*.pem
**/config/*.key
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/test
**/test/**
